  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Occupied Palestinian Territory 2011 CAP           Accompaniment Programme SEAPPI Christian Council  of Sweden</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d via FN:s humanit&#xE4;ra appell f&#xF6;r det ockuperadepalestinska territoriet 2011 till ledsagarprogram f&#xF6;r Sveriges kristna r&#xE5;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att minska brott mot m&#xE4;nskliga och humanit&#xE4;ra r&#xE4;ttigheter, i Palestina och Israel. Detta genom n&#xE4;rvaro i och genom att vara f&#xF6;ljeslagare inom samh&#xE4;llen d&#xE4;r m&#xE4;nniskor &#xE4;r utsatta f&#xF6;r brott mot sina r&#xE4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective is to decrease violations of HR and IHL in Palestine and Israel, when providing protection through preventive presence and accompaniment in communities and areas where people are vulnerable to violation of these rights.</narrative>
  </description>
